<Layout title="Refunds | Raising Noble"><section class="wrap sec prose"><p class="kicker">Support</p><h1 class="h1">Refunds and faulty files</h1><p>There are no change-of-mind refunds for digital products once delivered. If a file is faulty, won't open, or is missing, contact us and we will supply the files directly or fix the problem.</p><p>Our goods come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the Australian Consumer Law. You are entitled to a replacement or refund for a major failure and compensation for any other reasonably foreseeable loss or damage. You are also entitled to have the goods repaired or replaced if the goods fail to be of acceptable quality and the failure does not amount to a major failure.</p><p>We aim to reply within a few days.</p></section></Layout>
